  "raw_reply": "---- MODULE W4Od2m7p4t2 ----\nEXTENDS Integers\nCONSTANTS Dispatchers, Cap\nVARIABLES active, readSnapshots\nvars == <<active, readSnapshots>>\n\nTypeOK ==\n  /\\ active \\in {0, 1} -> {\"idle\", \"active\"}\n  /\\ readSnapshots \\in {\"idle\", \"active\"} -> {\"idle\", \"active\"}\nInit ==\n  /\\ active = [d \\in Dispatchers |-> \"idle\"]\n  /\\ readSnapshots = [d \\in Dispatchers, s \\in {\"idle\", \"active\"}\n                      |-> \"idle\"]\nRead(d) ==\n  /\\ readSnapshots[d] = \"idle\"\n  /\\ \\E c \\in {0, 1,..., Cap} :\n       /\\ \\A d' \\in Dispatchers : readSnapshots[d'] = \"idle\"\n       /\\ \\A d' \\neq d : readSnapshots[d'] = readSnapshots[d']\n       /\\ \\E snap : snap \\in {0, 1}\n       /\\ snap = (active[d] = \"idle\") => \"idle\"\n       /\\ snap = (active[d' | d' \\in Dispatchers, d' \\neq d] = \"idle\")\n       /\\ snap = (\\A d' \\in Dispatchers :\n                 readSnapshots[d'] = snap)\nAdmit(d) ==\n  /\\ Read(d)\n  /\\ \\E snap : snap = readSnapshots[d]\n  /\\ snap < Cap\n  /\\ \\E c \\in snap : c < Cap\n  /\\ \\E snap' : snap' = snap + 1\n  /\\ \\A d' \\in {d} : active[d'] = \"active\"\n  /\\ \\A d' \\notin {d} : active[d'] # \"active\"\n  /\\ \\E snap' : readSnapshots' = [snap' |-> snap']\n  /\\ snap' = snap\n  /\\ snap' < Cap\n  /\\ \\E d' \\in Dispatchers : snap' = snap'\n  /\\ snap' # snap\nLeave(d) ==\n  /\\ Read(d) \\/ Admit(d)\n  /\\ \\E snap' : active[d] = \"idle\"\n  /.active' == [active EXCEPT![d] = \"idle\"]\n  /.readSnapshots' == readSnapshots\n  /.vars == <<.active,.readSnapshots>>\nNext ==\n  \\/ \\E d \\in Dispatchers : Admit(d)\n  \\/ \\E d \\in {d \\in Dispatchers : Read(d)} : Leave(d)\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n====",
